# Models fetched by scripts/fetch_models.sh (zoo compile pinned by sha256).
# Vendored device artifact in this directory (no row here, kept via the
# .gitignore negation):
#   - hailo_yolov8n_384_640.hef — 640x384 fixed-resolution compile of the
#     secondary detection model; the generic zoo yolov8n is 640x640 and the
#     app's input_size=(640, 384) expects this exact build.
# Zoo pinning rationale: v5.3.0/hailo15h matches the device firmware
# (HailoRT 5.3.0). Re-verify with `hailortcli parse-hef` before bumping.
#
# ---- AMPK .bin packages (0.1.2, spec.models bundles) ----
# yolov8s_pose.bin / hailo_yolov8n_384_640.bin are AMPK v2 packages that wrap
# the vendored .hef files byte-identically (meta.hef.sha256 pins the inner
# bytes; the pose package embeds the same HEF as the zoo row below).
# app.yaml spec.models declares them; app-manager extracts them from the image
# at install, unpacks the HEF host-side under app-models/gym-ops/<alias>/ and
# preloads the registration (postprocess_profile pins the decoder: yolov8_pose
# => native_yolov8_pose create-time flag; hailo_yolov8n_384_640 => NMS
# backend). The app keeps a correct preloaded incumbent and only force-replaces
# a mis-routed one (app.py / registration.py).
#
# Regenerate after changing a .hef or its postprocess config (repo root):
#   python3 scripts/make_ampk_package.py --hef showcases/gym-ops/models/yolov8s_pose.hef \
#     --out showcases/gym-ops/models/yolov8s_pose.bin \
#     --model-id yolov8s_pose --model-type keypoint --profile yolov8_pose \
#     --config '{"threshold": 0.35, "keypoint_threshold": 0.25}' \
#     --net-name yolov8s_pose --net-width 640 --net-height 640
#   python3 scripts/make_ampk_package.py --hef showcases/gym-ops/models/hailo_yolov8n_384_640.hef \
#     --out showcases/gym-ops/models/hailo_yolov8n_384_640.bin \
#     --model-id yolov8n --model-type detection --profile hailo_yolov8n_384_640 \
#     --config '{"threshold": 0.25, "nms_threshold": 0.45, "max_detections": 64}' \
#     --net-name hailo_yolov8n_384_640 --net-width 640 --net-height 384 \
#     --output-format nms
# Thresholds mirror config.py MODEL_DEFS postprocess_json (pose) and the
# detection defaults; keep them in sync when tuning.
71ee6fd7ab02d66a2f34ecf753cb5adfb5c27bf6fc1a425b93206a76b9819d36	yolov8s_pose.hef	https://hailo-model-zoo.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/ModelZoo/Compiled/v5.3.0/hailo15h/yolov8s_pose.hef
